	(text "FM-1 MIDI dongle v5: USB-A host port (bottom face) for any class-compliant USB-MIDI synth.\nJLCPCB build: PCB 0.8 mm, 4 layers; J1 on the bottom face, every other part on top.\nNo D+/D- pull-downs: the X035 host port has them internally (RB_UH_PD_DIS = 0).\nTRS type A: tip = MIDI pin 5 (data), ring = pin 4 (source), sleeve = pin 2." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215 240 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "79e7772c-adb4-55e7-b143-f236556858b3"))
